          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "walkthrough:ww7i69:uvg0wy",
              "html": "If you haven&#39;t done so already, complete the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Power_Planter_I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Power Planter I</a> achievement, which involves earning 250 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Crux_Eqal_favour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Crux Eqal favour</a> and purchasing the first unlock in <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sydekix%27s_Shop_of_Balance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sydekix&#39;s Shop of Balance</a>. You can earn favour by planting and harvesting <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Herbs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">herbs</a> from any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Herb_patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">herb patch</a> in the game, including the one in the Garden of Kharid. You can ask the daily herb from Polletix, and planting and harvesting the daily herb always grants the maximum of 50 favour per seed. Planting the daily herb in five patches will satisfy this requirement. <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Herb_protector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Herb protector</a> can ensure that the patches do not become diseased and is fairly inexpensive to purchase.",
              "text": "If you haven't done so already, complete the Power Planter I achievement, which involves earning 250 Crux Eqal favour and purchasing the first unlock in Sydekix's Shop of Balance. You can earn favour by planting and harvesting herbs from any herb patch in the game, including the one in the Garden of Kharid. You can ask the daily herb from Polletix, and planting and harvesting the daily herb always grants the maximum of 50 favour per seed. Planting the daily herb in five patches will satisfy this requirement. Herb protector can ensure that the patches do not become diseased and is fairly inexpensive to purchase.",
